{"seq":1,"slug":"real-analysis","title":"实分析","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/advanced-mathematics-grad/real-analysis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"measure-theory","title":"研究生 高等数学进阶 — 测度论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/advanced-mathematics-grad/real-analysis/measure-theory","wordCount":1547,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"lebesgue-integration","title":"研究生 高等数学进阶 — Lebesgue 积分","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/advanced-mathematics-grad/real-analysis/lebesgue-integration","wordCount":1387,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"functional-analysis-intro","title":"研究生 高等数学进阶 — 泛函分析导引","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/advanced-mathematics-grad/real-analysis/functional-analysis-intro","wordCount":1397,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"实分析-简介\">实分析 简介</h1><p>本章以公理化方法重建分析学的理论基础，从集合论和测度论出发构建严格的积分理论，并初步引入泛函分析的基本框架。实分析是现代数学的基石，为概率论、偏微分方程和数学物理等领域提供不可替代的分析工具。</p>\n<p><strong>测度论</strong>从集合系统和测度的公理化定义出发，建立可测集和可测函数的基本理论，讨论外测度的构造方法和 Caratheodory 延拓定理，为 Lebesgue 积分的建立提供严格基础。<strong>Lebesgue 积分</strong>在测度论框架下发展积分理论，阐明 Lebesgue 积分相对于 Riemann 积分的本质优势，详细讲解单调收敛定理、Fatou 引理和控制收敛定理等核心极限定理，以及 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mi>p</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L^p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 空间的基本性质。<strong>泛函分析导引</strong>从赋范线性空间和 Banach 空间的基本概念入手，介绍有界线性算子、Hahn-Banach 定理和开映射定理等核心结果，建立从有限维到无限维分析的思维跨越。</p>\n<p>建议学习者重视定理证明的细节，独立完成每个定理的推导练习，在严格推理中培养分析直觉。</p>\n"}